From: Timur Ravilov <93673987+t0b1kent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:35:45 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 33/46] EXPERIMENT (not for publication): x87 fast path in the
 JIT (HB_X87_FAST package)

FADD/FSUB/FSUBR/FMUL/FDIV/FDIVR/FSQRT with FCW PC53 (or PC24 with MACRUNNER_HB_X87_FAST_PC24=1), RN,
all exceptions masked and guarded operands: host double/float operation, result range check, exact
F80 packing; otherwise the F80 helper. F32/F64 -> F80 loads of normal numbers without the helper.
Gate MACRUNNER_HB_X87_FAST=1 (default off); counters with MACRUNNER_HB_X87_FAST_PROOF=1.
Generated by the package's tools/prepare.py on series 0001-0019.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
